[Sheet: Header]
Cable Schedule: Wintbrook Processing Rooftop (PXA-2024-0099)
Fenmoor Electric LLC · Alleron Electrical Contractor Lic. #EC-12093
Drawing E-004 Rev C, 03/21/2025. Strings of 17 Halcrest HC-550M modules: Isc 14.0 A, Imp 13.1 A; string Vmp 712.3 V at 25 degC, 612.6 V at 65 degC cell temperature; maximum Voc 956.3 V at -23 degC.
DC feeder ampacity: 75 degC rating with a 0.88 ambient correction for 36 to 40 degC, both legs. Warehouse truss space: 40 degC, measured 06/2024. Roof leg: the EMT runs on supports at least 25 mm above the roof, at the ASHRAE 2 percent design dry bulb for Halston, 33 degC. Voltage drop at string Imp and 25 degC string Vmp. String circuits are rated at the rooftop design ambient.
Prepared: M. Iversen, Electrical Engineer, Fenmoor Electric LLC, 03/21/2025.
